v 3
d {bf:CVCOMBO}: Control-variable all-combinations robustness test
d
d CVCOMBO enumerates every nonempty combination of user-specified control
d variables and estimates each specification using a user-supplied
d estimation method. The package supports method() calls such as regress,
d xtreg, logit, probit, and reghdfe, provided the estimator accepts if/in
d qualifiers and returns _b[mainvar] and _se[mainvar].
d
d Version: 2.0.0
d Distribution-Date: 20260926
d Author: Jiang ZhenYuan (蒋镇源)
d Author: Zhang Na (张娜)
d Affiliation: School of Economics, Northwest Normal University
d Support: kangjang504@gmail.com
d Support: zhangna@nwnu.edu.cn
d Requires: Stata 15.1
d Optional estimator: reghdfe (install separately from SSC)
d After installation, type {cmd:help cvcombo}

f cvcombo.ado
f cvcombo.sthlp
